// Bundled E19.3 Conformance Probe (`T811` / `SPEC-102` `AXS-REF-001..063`,
// `INV-REF-001..003`, `REQ-TOOL-183`, `REQ-TOOL-186`, `REQ-TOOL-301..305`):
// Exercises `std.editor` + `std.vcs` + `compiler.query.db` + `compiler.lsp.protocol` +
// `compiler.lsp.vfs` + `compiler.lsp.handlers` + `compiler.refactor.transforms` +
// `compiler.refactor.code_actions` + `compiler.refactor.vcs.{diff,merge,patch,mod}` +
// `compiler.driver.refactor_cmd` end-to-end across `--interp` and native `-O0`.

